"answer": "The Q2 budget has been revised with a shift of funds towards emerging market bonds to potentially improve returns. Consequently, the profit forecast for Q2 has been increased by 3.5% to $9.378 million. However, these projections may need adjustment due to two factors: capital expenditure projects (new office building and IT infrastructure upgrade) coming in 10% over budget, and an unplanned IT security expenditure of $50,000. Additionally, cost-saving initiatives are proposed to offset some of these overages, potentially saving up to $200,000."
